床上，这个家里就一盏煤油灯，而且所剩下的油也不多了，唯一的那一点是奶奶今早去买回来的，因着在那些人来之前便已经装进了灯里，所以才没被拿走。诶，没有钱还真是各种不方便。“你脑袋真的摔坏了吗？”萧遗墨睁着一双黑眸，贴这墙壁侧躺着，观察着苏小凡脸上的每一个神情。“为何这么说？”苏小凡转过头，望进他的双眸，那晶亮的眸子，好比黑夜里的星星一般，闪耀夺目。“听说你醒来后，性情跟之前似乎不一样了。”“睡吧，小孩子太晚睡的话，可不好哦。”苏小凡笑笑，看了一眼悬挂在半空中的圆月后，幽幽道：“人总是会变的不是吗？等小宝贝儿长大了就会知道了。”虽然是敷衍他的话，但是即便自己告诉这些人真话，又有几个人会懂？恐怕只会真的当成自己是摔坏脑袋了吧。在她睡着后，萧遗墨偷偷的爬起床，迈着小腿儿打开门走了出去……隔日清晨，苏小凡早早的便醒了过来，坐起身看了看贴在墙角睡觉的萧遗墨，不禁疑惑，这孩子怎么小小年纪就清楚男女有别了？起床走出去后，见奶奶跟娘亲一早的就起来了。在她身后，原本紧闭双眼的这一幕突然睁开了眼，一双黑眸平静的望向她走出去的背影。“娘，你怎么不多睡会。”贾氏回头，见她走来，笑着说：“村长家，一早便将银子送了过来，你奶奶去镇上了，说要添些家里的日用品，还有这些东西，是村长家送来的，说是小少爷的衣物，你给搬进去吧。”“好。”苏小凡上前将那俩个小箱子拿进房中，摆放在床边上的空地，打开来正欲看看，回头见萧遗墨已经醒来正准备下床，急忙走了过去，为他穿好鞋子，然后将他小小的身子抱到了地面上。“女人，都说不要随便抱小爷了。”萧遗墨瞄了一眼送来的那些衣物，眼中闪过烦乱。“怎么？不喜欢那些衣服吗？”苏小凡看过去，那些衣服布料比自己现在穿的衣服不知好了多少倍，而且几乎都是全新的。扫了一眼萧遗墨身上的白袍子后，走过去挑了一件蓝色的准备给他换下。“干什么？”萧遗墨一脸戒备的看着正欲脱自己衣服的苏小凡，身子往后退了退。“换身衣服，等下我们要上山呀，你那白色的太容易脏了。”苏小凡朝他挪了挪。“知道了，你出去，小爷我自己会换。”萧遗墨夺过她手中的衣服，放在她身后，大有她不出去，就不换衣服的趋势。苏小凡惊讶：“真的吗？”一般小孩子这个年纪是不会自己穿衣服的吧。见他不回话，苏小凡只得走了出去，顺带着关上了门。“凡儿，来吃早饭吧，昨晚还剩下一些野菜粥，你跟小少爷吃了吧。”贾氏从厨房端出两碗饭，见她出来便笑着说。“好，奶奶跟娘吃了吗？”苏小凡上前接过一碗，几口便喝掉了，比昨晚更稀了，看来是加过水再煮了一次。“嗯，小少爷呢？”贾氏看了几眼紧闭的房门。“在换衣服呢。”苏小凡端着碗进厨房，放好碗筷准备走出去，眼角余光扫到墙角的水桶后，微有些惊讶，大声问：“娘，是你补的水桶吗？”贾氏将饭放到桌上，对着正开门走出来的萧遗墨说：“小少爷，吃早饭吧。”说完后，进了厨房：“不是哦，我跟你奶奶也不知道是谁补的，早上起来就这样了。”苏小凡听后，满腹疑惑，却也不打算深究，拎过昨日的篮子放好菜刀，走到院中，冲着堂屋内大吼：“小宝贝儿，要跟我去的话就快点哦。”萧遗墨狼吞虎咽的扒完一碗饭便冲了出来。半山腰，萧遗墨双手叉腰，回身看着落后自己好长一截的苏小凡，不耐烦的皱了皱眉：“女人，快点儿。”苏小凡抬头看了看，感概道：“年轻真好啊，精力十足。”“别在那装老，快点。”萧遗墨蹲在一块石头上，看着她如同一只蚂蚁一般在那慢慢的挪，好歹也是在山里长大的人，为何爬个山如此的墨迹？“唉。”苏小凡无奈的叹息，想从前，自己可是很喜欢爬山的呀，这副身子骨弱爆了。“摘野菜又不需要菜刀，你带刀上山来做什么？”等了半天，苏小凡终于走了过来，萧遗墨望见了她篮子里的菜刀后疑惑的出声。“备用呀，万一有个毒蛇猛兽什么的，我会保护你的。”苏小凡喘着气儿对他一笑。萧遗墨忍不住翻白眼，就她这体力，真遇上毒蛇猛兽，真能保护自己？自保都不行吧。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongfuchengyin-nongjiatongyangxi/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 7 I Will Protect You After dinner and everything was tidied up, Su Xiaofan took Xiao Yimo back to the room. There were only two rooms in the house. Originally, grandma shared a room with him, and mother shared a room with dad. After her father died, grandma said her mother would be lonely, so she moved in and slept with her. \"Okay, let's go to bed, little darling.\" Su Xiaofan held Xiao Yimo in his hands, then knelt down and took off his shoes. \"Woman, don't just hug me.\" Xiao Yimo's cheeks were slightly red, he turned his head awkwardly, reached out and patted the bed beneath him, frowned and asked, \"Will the bed collapse suddenly in the middle of the night?\" After Su Xiaofan put away his little shoes, he looked at the man with only two hands. A stool and a super simple bed made of a wooden board. If she thought about it in her own way, she was also worried that the bed would collapse, but in her memory, Su Xiaofan had slept with her grandma for more than ten years, so it must not collapse so easily. \"No, don't worry, and even if it collapses, I will protect you, don't worry.\" Su Xiaofan comforted him, hoping that he could sleep peacefully. \"Master, I'm not worried. It won't hurt even if you fall from such a height.\" \"Fan'er, are you okay? I'm going to turn off the lights.\" Ye's voice came from outside the door. Su Xiaofan responded loudly to the door: \"Okay, grandma.\" After answering, the room fell into darkness for a moment, and then his eyes gradually adapted. The moonlight shone in through the broken window lattice. Su Xiaofan lay on the bed with troubled thoughts. There was only one kerosene lamp in the house, and there was not much oil left. The only one was bought by grandma this morning. Because it had been put into the lamp before those people came, it was not taken away. Hey, it’s really inconvenient to have no money. \"Did you really break your head?\" Xiao Yimo lay on his side against the wall with his dark eyes open, observing every expression on Su Xiaofan's face. \"Why do you say that?\" Su Xiaofan turned his head and looked into his eyes. Those bright eyes were like stars in the dark night, shining brightly. \"I heard that your temperament seems to be different after you wake up.\" \"Go to sleep. It's not good for children to go to bed too late.\" Su Xiaofan smiled, glanced at the full moon hanging in the sky, and said quietly: \"People always change, right? You will know when the little baby grows up.\" Although it was perfunctory, how many people would understand even if he told these people the truth? I'm afraid I'll just think that I broke my head. After she fell asleep, Xiao Yimo climbed up secretly, opened the door with his legs and walked out... The next morning, Su Xiaofan woke up early, sat up and looked at Xiao Yimo who was sleeping in the corner, and couldn't help but wonder, how could this child know the difference between men and women at such a young age? After getting up and going out, I saw my grandma and mother getting up early in the morning. Behind her, her eyes, which were originally closed, suddenly opened, and a pair of black eyes looked calmly at her back as she walked out. \"Mom, why don't you sleep more.\" Jia turned around and saw her coming, and said with a smile: \"The village chief's family sent the money here early in the morning. Your grandma went to town and said she wanted to add some daily necessities for the house. These things were sent by the village chief's family, saying they were the young master's clothes. You can move them in. Go.\" \"Okay.\" Su Xiaofan stepped forward, took the two small boxes into the room, and placed them in the open space next to the bed. He opened them and was about to take a look. When he turned around, he saw that Xiao Yimo had woken up and was about to get out of bed. He hurriedly walked over, put on his shoes, and then lifted his small body to the ground. \"Women, they all told you not to hug me casually.\" Xiao Yimo glanced at the clothes that were delivered, and annoyance flashed in his eyes. \"What? Don't you like those clothes?\" Su Xiaofan looked over and saw that the fabrics of those clothes were many times better than the clothes he was wearing now, and they were almost all brand new. After glancing at Xiao Yimo's white robe, he walked over and picked out a blue one for him to change into. \"What are you doing?\" Xiao Yimo looked at Su Xiaofan who was about to take off his clothes with a wary expression and stepped back. \"Change into clothes, we are going up the mountain later. Your white clothes get dirty easily.\" Su Xiaofan moved towards him. \"I know, you go out, I will change myself.\" Xiao Yimo took the clothes from her hand and put them behind her. It seemed that she would not change clothes until she went out. Su Xiaofan was surprised: \"Really?\" Most children at this age don't know how to dress themselves. Seeing that he didn't reply, Su Xiaofan had no choice but to walk out and close the door. \"Fan'er, come and have breakfast. There is still some wild vegetable porridge left from last night. You and the young master can eat it.\" Jia took out two bowls of rice from the kitchen and said with a smile when she saw her coming out. \"Okay, have grandma and mother eaten?\" Su Xiaofan stepped forward to take a bowl and drank it in a few mouthfuls. It was thinner than last night. It seemed that it had been boiled again with water. \"Well, where is the young master?\" Jia glanced at the closed door a few times. \"I'm changing clothes.\" Su Xiaofan carried the bowl into the kitchen, put down the dishes and chopsticks and was about to go out. He glanced at the bucket in the corner from the corner of his eye and was a little surprised. He asked loudly: \"Mom, did you fill the bucket?\" Jia put the rice on the table and said to Xiao Yimo who was opening the door and walked out: \"Young master, let's have breakfast.\" After saying that, he entered the kitchen: \"No. Yes, your grandma and I don't know who made it up. It was like this when we woke up in the morning.\" After hearing this, Su Xiaofan was full of doubts, but he didn't want to go into details. He picked up yesterday's basket and put the kitchen knife, walked into the courtyard, and shouted to the main room: \"Baby, if you want to come with me, hurry up.\" Xiao Yimo wolfed down a bowl of rice and rushed out. Halfway up the mountain, Xiao Yimo put his hands on his hips and turned around to look at Su Xiaofan, who was a long way behind him. He frowned impatiently: \"Woman, hurry up.\" Su Xiaofan looked up and said with emotion: \"It's great to be young, full of energy.", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}